WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.497
What did you do on Sunday?

00:00:02.747 --> 00:00:06.012
I went to the park with a friend.

00:00:06.262 --> 00:00:08.603
Did you play football?

00:00:08.853 --> 00:00:13.343
No, it rained. We had a coffee.

00:00:13.593 --> 00:00:16.036
Afterwards, I went home.
